        "name": "Humble-Knight",
        "username": "Humble-Knight",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/humble-knight/{size}/2259_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-05-10T03:31:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, what Amnachaidh said. One time I played 2 Apocalypses like they were devestating auroras so i got 2 wipes, then later in the same game I killed the orb by redirecting Apostate's boosted shock rounds damage to it, allowing me to kill every single relic that round, then kill him the next. It all evens out</p>",
