      {
        "id": 101733,
        "name": "TheTroll",
        "username": "TheTroll",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thetroll/{size}/2690_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-05-20T06:54:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Me, I was playing with two friends, we were fighting Omnitron in Rook City. They were using AZ and Haka while I was using Mister Fixer. Omnitron takes them out but it was such a heated battle that we had him down to 2 hp and I had 1 hp. I was deflecting damage left and right to hurt Omnitron but we knew we were on the last environmental turn and I had to do something to survive the onslaught on the Villain's turn which we knew was going to stop me.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Tony Taurus comes out and does his thing, I let the damage hit me and redirect in onto Omnitron. The other two blink for a second and then we cheer when we realize that we just beat Omnitron when it took us 5 times before to beat him. I figured Tony appeared behind Mister Fixer, told him to duck and fired with Fixer ducking and kicking the bullet to send it to the great big glob of skynet. Game Over, Players Win.</p>",
        "post_number": 27,
        "post_type": 1,
